This member spotlight tells the story of a retail counter clerk who advanced to a buyer role, emphasizing that curiosity and practical learning, rather than a rigid career plan or certifications alone, were key to her professional growth in the cheese industry. It highlights the value of continuous learning, informal mentorship, and asking insightful questions to suppliers.
 
