This FAQ page from the International Cheese Federation (ICF) provides detailed information regarding membership costs across various categories (Professional, Associate, Student, Emerging Professional, Retired, Corporate), eligibility criteria, mid-year prorated dues, refund policies, and procedures for rejoining or reviewing past denials. It outlines the benefits and management of corporate memberships and student verification requirements.
 
