This article, presented as a member spotlight, highlights the critical importance of retail cheese management, focusing on the challenges of maintaining product quality through effective supply chain and cold chain logistics, especially during summer. It emphasizes that proper handling, merchandising, and staff training at the retail counter are as crucial for a cheese program''s success as the cheesemaking process itself.
 
