This article from the International Cheese Federation discusses the dairy income-over-feed-cost margin''s improvement in early 2019, its implications for milk suppliers and creameries, and how these financial indicators affect supply reliability and future contracts within the cheese industry. It also touches on the federal margin-support program and advises members on understanding supplier health and pricing strategies.
 
