This internal presentation deck from the International Cheese Federation''s Events Team discusses the readiness of two upcoming in-person workshops: the Cedar Packaging Workshop in Tandil and the Prairie Food Safety Workshop in Lancaster. It provides an update on registration numbers, highlights the different performance of each workshop, and proposes a strategy for the Lancaster event, which is experiencing slower sign-ups. The team needs to make decisions regarding a targeted reminder, pricing, and assigning an owner for a follow-up check.
