This post discusses the International Cheese Federation''s Competition Judge Accreditation, explaining its two-year lapse period and the requirement for active participation to maintain the credential. It outlines the pathway to accreditation, which typically begins with the Sensory Evaluation Certificate, and emphasizes the importance of qualified judges for the credibility of cheese competition medals in a competitive market.
 
