This post announces the impending registration deadline for a hands-on, small-group ''Meadow Affinage'' workshop. It emphasizes the practical, experiential learning in a working cheese cave, focusing on nuanced judgment calls in affinage rather than theoretical lectures. The workshop is designed for members seeking practical hours for the Advanced Affinage Certificate and highlights the unique value of in-person, hands-on training compared to virtual alternatives.
 
