This document describes a free, virtual webinar hosted by the International Cheese Federation (ICF) focusing on wholesale negotiation strategies for members. The webinar addresses how fluctuating cheese and milk prices, cross-border tariffs, and trade conditions impact supplier and buyer dynamics. It provides practical guidance on reading supplier positions, structuring multi-month agreements with price adjustments, and evaluating deal terms.
 
