This post from the International Cheese Federation (ICF) provides a pre-conference update for its Annual Conference, two weeks out. It details registration status, highlights key program tracks including trade and export sessions (focusing on documentation, buyer relationships, and tariffs) and a ''cave-and-craft'' track (affinage, judging calibration), and offers practical logistical advice for attendees regarding registration, mentor lists, cave tours, and on-site conditions.
 
