This FAQ details the benefits of joining the International Cheese Federation (ICF), including member pricing on certifications, education, access to resources, and networking. It clarifies ICF''s focus compared to the American Cheese Society (ACS) and regional guilds, and outlines eligibility for international producers, consultants, and those working with plant-based cheese alternatives.
 
